OL,3,GNEWSARecord breaking kite surfer finds
OL,4,A'magic gust'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn acclaimed kite surfer from West
OL,7,FSussex who recently made history with a
OL,8,Frecord-breaking jump said he is
OL,9,F"ecstatic that the record has come to
OL,10,Fthe UK, to my home area".
OL,12,FLewis Crathern, from Worthing, reached
OL,13,F42.6m (139.76 ft) during a stormy
OL,14,Fsession at Bracklesham Bay last Friday,
OL,15,Fafter finding what he called "that
OL,16,Fmagic gust".
OL,18,FThe jump, which was independently
OL,19,Fverified as a world record by the WOO
OL,20,Fsports platform, is another in a long
OL,21,Flist of career achievements for the
OL,22,F41-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
