OL,3,GNEWSARecord breaking kite surfer finds
OL,4,A'magic gust'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "I have been doing this for 22
OL,7,Fyears, I grew up on the seafront in
OL,8,FWorthing, I feel very comfortable in
OL,9,Fthe stormy ocean."
